  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "成長"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">作者：</span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>葉月春&nbsp;</b></span></p><p><br /></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">M̄知uì tueh開始</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">拜五食暗了後　阿母就huan咐好勢</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">拜六放學了後　ài khau草牽番薯藤</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">一粒一粒真珠sì-kè kō</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">He是身軀上珍貴ê bi-tá-bín</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">M̄知uì tueh起鼓</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">台灣經濟mā beh tńg大人</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">農產品變做機械加工場</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">一pha一pha電火閃閃爍爍</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">He是阮暗暝拚勢ê元氣</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">M̄知uì tueh起飛</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">大學出業了後　走ná飛--leh tńg來故鄉</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">科學園區tsiânn做阮ê大雄丸</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Mā是科技新貴ê黃金地</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">就án-ne</span></p><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">台灣錢淹跤目thàng全世界</span></p></blockquote><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">M̄知uì tueh起行</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">半ló老ê青春歲月　沓沓仔行倚--來</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">身體有時phīng氣象台koh-khah靈siànn</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">M̄-koh食老m̄認老、囡仔性ê我</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">就án-ne</span></p><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">suah leh kah囡仔做伙搬歌仔戲</span></p></blockquote><p>&nbsp;</p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjHZp89gej9fVsjvI8TtwQwa85_jNKqf9fVakE1d1W00t2_hkG23wgtC4VchSk8en_OQudIrjxSNH_Lc68pOImr_pZc7rNHxJoAbjNMSzMjbVdw8hZLM1jZTPL5caeo6DNhytyYB4lxDaifi4GDHtHYb4CFJW9O-ftqBPvvRxRNumBQLflJW0Ulebo8Hb6v/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1370%E6%9C%9F_5.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjHZp89gej9fVsjvI8TtwQwa85_jNKqf9fVakE1d1W00t2_hkG23wgtC4VchSk8en_OQudIrjxSNH_Lc68pOImr_pZc7rNHxJoAbjNMSzMjbVdw8hZLM1jZTPL5caeo6DNhytyYB4lxDaifi4GDHtHYb4CFJW9O-ftqBPvvRxRNumBQLflJW0Ulebo8Hb6v/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1370%E6%9C%9F_5.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a name='more'></a><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEho_NJb6Iy6OuvA8Jx7YHRcAyJBoZ6cpxm_7cQvnh2-sQTbq1xBRM5Z1nh77keV8mSsCzoILZi4S0H1b3MH0DGX5mojieJVFOJ7eB7SmA_BgGqfYjnbZsITwtx6ZTPlXV